  <path d="M12 9v4" />
  <path d="M12 17h.01" />
</svg>
    <h2>Registrar mismatch</h2>
    <section><p>The inventory says Namecheap, but the registry reports <strong>Cloudflare, Inc.</strong>. If a transfer finished, update the inventory in Pulumi.</p></section>
  </div>
  
  

  <div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2">
    <div class="card">
      <header>
        <h2>Renewal</h2>
        <p>The expiry comes from Cloudflare, else RDAP, else the inventory.</p>
      </header>
      <section>
        <dl class="kv">
          <dt>Expires</dt>
          <dd>2027-07-23 12:00 UTC <span class="text-muted-foreground">(in 300d, from RDAP)</span></dd>
          <dt>Auto-renew</dt>
          <dd>on <span class="text-muted-foreground">· from inventory</span></dd>
          <dt>Per year</dt>
          <dd>$61.98 <span class="text-muted-foreground">· from price table</span></dd>
          <dt>Alerts</dt>
          <dd>warning 30d before <span class="text-muted-foreground">(skipped: auto-renew is on)</span>, critical 7d before</dd>
          
        </dl>
        
      </section>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <header>
        <h2>Registration</h2>
        <p>What the registry reports over RDAP.</p>
      </header>
      <section class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        
        
        <dl class="kv">
          <dt>Registrar</dt>
          <dd>Cloudflare, Inc.</dd>
          <dt>Registered</dt>
          <dd>2025-08-22</dd>
          <dt>Expires</dt>
          <dd>2027-07-23</dd>
          <dt>Last changed</dt>
          <dd>2026-03-10</dd>
          <dt>Nameservers</dt>
          <dd><code class="block text-xs">ada.ns.cloudflare.com</code><code class="block text-xs">bob.ns.cloudflare.com</code></dd>
          <dt>Checked</dt>
          <dd>42m ago · <a class="underline underline-offset-4" href="https://rdap.example/domain" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">raw</a></dd>
        </dl>
        
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
          <span class="badge" data-variant="outline">client transfer prohibited</span>
        </div>
        
        
      </section>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <header>
        <h2>Inventory</h2>
        <p>As declared by Pulumi.</p>
      </header>
      <section class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <dl class="kv">
          <dt>Source</dt>
          <dd><code class="text-xs">domains/domains.json</code></dd>
          <dt>Registrar</dt>
          <dd><code class="text-xs">namecheap</code></dd>
        </dl>
        
      </section>
    </div>
    
  </div>
</div>

